      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The most efficient approach is to acknowledge the customer's frustration immediately and apologize sincerely for the damaged item. Offer a full replacement of the vase shipped expedited at no cost to them. If the customer declines a replacement, offer a partial refund instead of a full one to encourage satisfaction while mitigating loss. This proactive service recovery often resolves disputes before they escalate to chargebacks.",
